    {
      "text": "Page excerpt with text and a forest plot (Figure 4) of the adjusted geometric mean ratio for time to TB diagnosis. One study, Cattamanchi 2021 (N = 10664), has an estimate of 0.49 (95% CI 0.39 to 0.62), lying left of the line of no effect at 1, on the side labelled 'Favours Xpert Ultra'.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
